ent_html__0OZLp" data-qd-rendered-description=3D"" data-track-load=3D"descr=
iption_content"><p>Design a data structure that follows the constraints of =
a <strong><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cache_replacement_polici=
es#LRU" target=3D"_blank">Least Recently Used (LRU) cache</a></strong>.</p>

<p>Implement the <code>LRUCache</code> class:</p>

<ul>
	<li><code>LRUCache(int capacity)</code> Initialize the LRU cache with <str=
ong>positive</strong> size <code>capacity</code>.</li>
	<li><code>int get(int key)</code> Return the value of the <code>key</code>=
 if the key exists, otherwise return <code>-1</code>.</li>
	<li><code>void put(int key, int value)</code> Update the value of the <cod=
e>key</code> if the <code>key</code> exists. Otherwise, add the <code>key-v=
alue</code> pair to the cache. If the number of keys exceeds the <code>capa=
city</code> from this operation, <strong>evict</strong> the least recently =
used key.</li>
</ul>

<p>The functions <code>get</code> and <code>put</code> must each run in <co=
de>O(1)</code> average time complexity.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong class=3D"example">Example 1:</strong></p>

<pre><strong>Input</strong>
["LRUCache", "put", "put", "get", "put", "get", "put", "get", "get", "get"]
[[2], [1, 1], [2, 2], [1], [3, 3], [2], [4, 4], [1], [3], [4]]
<strong>Output</strong>
[null, null, null, 1, null, -1, null, -1, 3, 4]

<strong>Explanation</strong>
LRUCache lRUCache =3D new LRUCache(2);
lRUCache.put(1, 1); // cache is {1=3D1}
lRUCache.put(2, 2); // cache is {1=3D1, 2=3D2}
lRUCache.get(1);    // return 1
lRUCache.put(3, 3); // LRU key was 2, evicts key 2, cache is {1=3D1, 3=3D3}
lRUCache.get(2);    // returns -1 (not found)
lRUCache.put(4, 4); // LRU key was 1, evicts key 1, cache is {4=3D4, 3=3D3}
lRUCache.get(1);    // return -1 (not found)
lRUCache.get(3);    // return 3
lRUCache.get(4);    // return 4
</pre>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>

<ul>
	<li><code>1 &lt;=3D capacity &lt;=3D 3000</code></li>
	<li><code>0 &lt;=3D key &lt;=3D 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>
	<li><code>0 &lt;=3D value &lt;=3D 10<sup>5</sup></code></li>
	<li>At most <code>2 * 10<sup>5</sup></code> calls will be made to <code>ge=
t</code> and <code>put</code>.</li>
</ul>
